    "groups": [
      {
        "label": "Additional rewards/activities",
        "items": [
          {
            "html": "2,000 experience for engraving <i>&quot;With beauty blessed.&quot;</i> on a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ruby_bracelet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ruby bracelet</a> - requires 42 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crafting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Crafting</a>",
            "text": "2,000 experience for engraving \"With beauty blessed.\" on a ruby bracelet - requires 42 Crafting",
            "subs": []
          },
          {
            "html": "10,000 experience for engraving <i>&quot;Gudrun&quot;</i> on a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dragonstone_necklace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dragonstone necklace</a> - requires 72 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crafting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Crafting</a>",
            "text": "10,000 experience for engraving \"Gudrun\" on a dragonstone necklace - requires 72 Crafting",
            "subs": []
          },
          {
            "html": "20,000 experience for engraving <i>&quot;The most beautiful girl in the room.&quot;</i> on an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Onyx_amulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">onyx amulet</a> - requires 90 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crafting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Crafting</a>",
            "text": "20,000 experience for engraving \"The most beautiful girl in the room.\" on an onyx amulet - requires 90 Crafting",
            "subs": []
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "After the quest, you can go to what used to be <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Juliet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Juliet&#39;s</a> house (southeast of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cooks%27_Guild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cooks&#39; Guild</a>) and Dororan is now living there with Gudrun. You can talk to Dororan and ask for additional tasks to engrave jewellery for him and receive up to 32,000 experience. This is done within the dialogue and no items in the backpack are involved or required. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Free-to-play\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Free-to-play</a> players can engrave the jewellery even though they can only be obtained by members. Temporary boosts work."
    ]
